==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|VL.|*postius}}, comparative of {{inh|fr|la|post}}.<ref>{{cite-book|last=Picoche|first=Jacqueline|coauthors=Jean-Claude Rolland|title=Dictionnaire étymologique du français|year=2009|publisher=Dictionnaires Le Robert|location=Paris|language=French|pages=|chapter=}}</ref> Compare {{cog|pt|pois}}, {{cog|es|pues}}, {{cog|it|poi}}, and {{cog|ro|apoi}} (archaic {{m|ro|păi}}).

